---
system: sys-02-device-provisioning-registry
flow_id: decommission
surface: mobile
spec_anchor: /software/systems/02-device-provisioning-registry#devices-lifecycle-state-ownership-lifecycle
actors: [ParentApp, Gateway, DeviceService, PostgreSQL, DecommissionWorker, Device]
apis:
  - POST /v1/devices/:deviceId/decommission
externals: []
queues: [devices.transitions]
failure_paths:
  - not_owner_role
  - device_busy_pending_ota
  - device_already_decommissioned
idempotency: idempotent — repeat call on lifecycle_state in {decommission_pending, decommissioned} returns 200 with current state
retry: parent app retries on 5xx with exponential backoff
timeout: 5s p99
status: final
---
%% HAND-CURATED.
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant ParentApp
    participant Gateway
    participant DeviceService
    participant PostgreSQL
    participant DecommissionWorker
    participant Device

    ParentApp->>Gateway: POST /v1/devices/:deviceId/decommission (Parent bearer token, role=owner)
    Gateway->>DeviceService: forward
    alt not_owner_role
        DeviceService-->>ParentApp: 403 not_owner_role
    else device_busy_pending_ota
        DeviceService-->>ParentApp: 409 device_busy_pending_ota
    else device_already_decommissioned
        DeviceService-->>ParentApp: 200 {lifecycleState=decommissioned} (idempotent)
    else success
        DeviceService->>PostgreSQL: UPDATE devices SET lifecycle_state='decommission_pending' then INSERT audit event
        PostgreSQL-->>DeviceService: ok
        DeviceService-->>ParentApp: 202 {lifecycleState=decommission_pending}
    end

    DeviceService->>DecommissionWorker: enqueue devices.transitions.decommission_workflow
    DecommissionWorker->>PostgreSQL: txn — close active device_ownership_history (ownership_status='decommissioned'), UPDATE devices SET status='decommissioned' lifecycle_state='decommissioned' decommissioned_at

    Note over Device,DecommissionWorker: cloud notifies device on next heartbeat — runtime transitions to DECOMMISSIONED (sys-03 §4.2) clears local personalization, disables wake-word

    Note over ParentApp,PostgreSQL: timeout 5s p99 · 8.8 from failure-matrix — decommission rejected if pending OTA · audit + immutable ownership-history record per security control
